 content="""
termux now includes a git-annex package, and that avoids the proot hack
that the git-annex.linux standalone build uses to run on android.

So, I think that would be the solution to this problem. 

Since using the termux package is now the recommended way to install
git-annex on android, and whatever the problem with proot is unlikely to
get resolved, I'm going to close this.
"""]]
